#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Witness: local file transcription with optional speaker diarization.

Every surfaced word comes from one transcription engine, Parakeet Ultra.
Witness supplies the structure around it (language label, speech windows,
speaker turns):

1. Convert input to 16 kHz mono WAV.
2. For ``--language auto``, use Whisper only as an EN/FR language classifier
   for the label in the output; Parakeet Ultra detects language itself.
3. Run speakrs first when diarization is enabled (GPU, then CPU fallback).
4. Split speaker turns into windows of up to 35 seconds with 5 second overlap.
5. Send every window to one Parakeet Ultra process that loads its model once.
6. Remove exact overlap duplicates and emit Markdown, JSON, or SRT.
"""

